    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stop pretending i still exist... that's exactly it. it's like i'm just watching a movie of someone else's life. there's no spark, no reason to even get up tomorrow. even when i try to eat or sleep, it just feels like i'm performing these chores for a person who isnt even there. is it even worth it? to just keep going through the motions of living when the person I actually lived for is gone?",
